[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_RUBBER]
Plant!

[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_RUBBER_desc]
It is well known that rubber is a useful natural resource. Rubber chicken toys, for example, are rich in rubber. In fact, the main component of rubber chicken toys is rubber.\nIn the rainy season, farmers plant rubber chicken seeds and wait for them to grow. On sunny and dry days, farmers work hard in the fields to take care of the rubber chickens that are about to mature. When the harvest season comes, farmers harvest the rubber chickens, extract the rich rubber from them, and sell it to the market.\nRubber has a wide range of applications in life, such as rubber chicken toys. Rubber chicken toys are a very popular toy, with a cute appearance, and rubber chicken toys can also make a “squeak” sound, which is very interesting.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_RUBBER]
种！

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_RUBBER_desc]
众所周知，橡胶是一种有用的自然资源。举个例子，橡胶鸡玩具就富含橡胶，事实上，橡胶鸡玩具的主要成分就是橡胶。\n在雨季，农民们会种下橡胶鸡的种子，等待它们长大。在晴朗而干燥的日子里，农民们会在田地里辛苦工作，保养即将成熟的橡胶鸡。而到了收获的季节，农民们会收获橡胶鸡，然后提取其中丰富橡胶向市场出售。\n橡胶在生活中的应用非常广泛，比如橡胶鸡玩具就是其中之一。橡胶鸡玩具是一种非常受欢迎的玩具，它的外形可爱，而且橡胶鸡玩具还可以发出“吱吱”的声音，非常有趣。

